WEBVTT

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:41.530
<i>The mysterious world where Digimon live,
the Digital World.</i>

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:47.080
<i>The adventure of Taichi Yagami
and the Chosen Ones</i>

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:50.540
<i>with their partner Digimon continue.</i>

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:56.590
<i>The key to saving the world,
one of the Holy Digimon, Patamon.</i>

00:01:57.220 --> 00:02:01.970
<i>The powers and wings
which were nearly lost in a fierce battle</i>

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:06.230
<i>were gradually returning
as the bond with Takeru grew stronger.</i>

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:07.560
<i>And now...</i>

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:16.860
MON-MON PARK IN THE FOG

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:19.280
That was a big hill.

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:21.530
Good work, Komondomon!

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:26.410
Phew! I'm beat!

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:28.580
That was tough!

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:30.790
How is it, Joe?

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:33.960
Gomamon, I can't thank you enough.

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:36.380
I told you. Don't worry about it!

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:38.880
Are we staying here for the night?

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:40.050
Yes.

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:43.140
I don't sense anything bad around.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:46.890
Just in case,
me and Agumon will scout the area.

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:49.140
Oh, I'll go too.

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:51.850
Let's go scout!

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:56.900
Um... do you understand
what "scout" means?

00:02:57.230 --> 00:03:00.360
We'll go look to see
if there's any food around.

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:08.750
You could've stayed back there.

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:11.420
I want to help everyone too.

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:13.330
I see.

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:20.800
It's getting foggy.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.140
We might get lost.

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:26.560
Should we head back?

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:29.560
What is it?

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:31.640
Yamato, look.

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:36.150
MON-MON PARK

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:36.150
That wasn't there earlier, right?

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:47.990
A Ferris wheel, a roller-coaster...

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:52.210
Could this be a theme park?

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:53.670
A theme park?

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:57.420
It's a really fun place in our world!

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:00.420
But why is it in the Digital World?

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:02.720
Yamato, isn't that...

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:08.930
This is the park's symbol, Monzaemon!

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:15.600
Hup!

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:20.690
And who might you be?

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:24.780
Wait a minute, I'm not a bad Digimon!

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:29.700
I'm Opossummon,
Mon-Mon Park's guide!

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:28.620
OPOSSUMMON

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:32.000
Mon-Mon Park?

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:38.000
Yup! This is where Digimon come to play.
It's a very fun land of dreams!

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:43.170
Oh... but as you can see,
we're quite empty right now.

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:49.220
But now that we finally have customers,
I'm super happy!

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:55.020
Sorry, but we're not customers.
We just came to look for food.

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:57.730
No way!

00:04:58.060 --> 00:04:59.270
No way!

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:01.020
No way...

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:06.070
Yamato, I feel bad.
Why don't we stop by a little?

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:08.950
Just for a little while, okay?

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:11.700
Alright!

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:16.540
Then Mon-Mon Park shall now open!

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:19.790
MON-MON PARK

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:39.060
So high!

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:41.820
But we can't really see anything.

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:44.820
It's no use.

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:47.570
Hey, Yamato?

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:50.240
Do you remember?

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:54.330
When we went to the theme park...
with all of us.

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:55.830
Yeah...

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:03.210
How could I forget?

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:05.170
That was fun.

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:06.300
Yeah.

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:12.300
We didn't go into the haunted house
because you said you were scared.

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:15.060
What? Is that true, Yamato?!

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:17.770
Whatever!

00:06:17.930 --> 00:06:21.810
You were crying because you were
scared of the roller-coaster too!

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:23.820
Is that true, Takeru?

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:26.780
Oh, was I?

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:29.030
Yeah, you were!

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:36.290
Oh!

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:40.790
What did you find?

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:42.290
A merry-go-round!

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:45.340
Merry-go-round...

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:05.770
Back then...

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:17.290
Hey, what's wrong?

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:19.870
XIAOMON

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:20.460
Run...

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:23.080
This place is dangerous.

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:26.840
Everybody's going to be...

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:31.720
Whoopsie-daisy!

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:35.600
Looks like I let one escape.

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:37.600
What do you mean?!

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:40.640
I was going to wait
until you let your guard down,

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:42.690
but I have no choice now!

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:50.610
So you were a bad Digimon after all!

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:03.540
Takeru!

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:04.620
Yeah!

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:05.880
Patamon!

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:08.250
Patamon Evolution!

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:14.050
Pegasmon!

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:16.550
Gabumon!

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:36.700
Gabumon Evolution!

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:51.800
Garurumon!

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:04.940
Pegasmon!

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:07.440
Needle Rain!

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:26.120
Fox Fire!

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:28.920
Silver Blaze!

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:38.220
Takeru!

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:41.220
Takeru!

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:44.140
Yamato!

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:54.320
Takeru...

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:04.740
The voice came from here...

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:06.870
Yamato...

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:11.750
Where did that Opossummon go?!

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:13.960
Takeru!

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:16.010
Yamato!

00:10:18.170 --> 00:10:19.380
Takeru!

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:21.510
Yamato!

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:23.850
It's coming from in here.

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:32.690
So this is the haunted house
you two were talking about earlier.

00:10:33.060 --> 00:10:36.570
Who would've thought
I'd have to enter one like this?

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:37.440
What?

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:40.160
Uh, no, it's nothing.

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:43.740
What is it?!

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:49.460
Yamato!

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:51.370
Yamato!

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:53.420
Yamato!

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:57.170
You fell for it?

00:10:57.380 --> 00:10:58.920
It was a trap!

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:08.680
You said "everybody" earlier.
Are there others besides you?

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:14.060
My friends who wandered
in here together were all captured.

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:18.360
They were all swallowed
by this big scary thing.

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:38.880
What do you mean "swallowed"?

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:42.430
<i>Before the black lightning stopped,</i>

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:46.760
<i>we were scared and hiding in this forest.</i>

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:49.770
<i>But suddenly,
this place appeared before us.</i>

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:54.770
<i>We saw many things we'd never seen before
and everyone was immersed in them.</i>

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:58.020
<i>Then all of a sudden...</i>

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:26.760
They terrorized you in a place where
you're supposed to make happy memories?

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:30.100
That's unforgivable!

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:36.060
This sound...

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:41.570
Rodeo Gallop!

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:49.330
I gotcha! I gotcha!

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:50.700
Stop!

00:13:00.670 --> 00:13:01.840
Garurumon!

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:17.190
Garurumon Super Evolution!

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:33.080
Weregarurumon!

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:43.510
Takeru...

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:51.890
Snacks! Snacks! It's snack time!

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:53.600
Stop!

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:55.850
Too bad!

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:01.520
You're too late!

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:06.490
Now, take a good look!

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:09.240
Here's Mon-Mon Park's real mascot,

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:11.740
Warumonzaemon!

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.750
WARUMONZAEMON

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:26.760
Warumonzaemon, an Ultimate Digimon!

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:32.800
Now, swallow those guys too
and become even stronger!

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:35.470
Rodeo Gallop!

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:40.520
Shooting Star!

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:49.650
Useless! Useless!

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:54.990
Warumonzaemon that swallowed a ton
of Digimon is unbeatable!

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:57.660
Silver Blaze!

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:07.460
Warumonzaemon will become stronger
with you as nutrients!

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:09.510
Can't wait! Can't wait!

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:11.260
Nutrients?

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:12.720
Uh-huh!

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:17.270
We're taking energy from
lots of Digimon in here right now!

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:21.600
Thanks to that, Warumonzaemon
can become infinitely strong!

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:25.020
My sweet, sweet Warumonzaemon!

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:28.650
Everyone's in there...

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:29.780
Pegasmon!

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:30.780
Yeah!

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:33.990
What is that?!

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:36.780
Takeru!

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:40.040
Oh, they're doing us a favor
by coming at us.

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:43.540
Warumonzaemon, open wide!

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:48.300
Takeru!

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:53.050
Kaiser Nail!

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:07.770
Patamon!

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:09.400
I'm okay.

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:10.320
Oh...

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:14.530
So you two were swallowed too.

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:27.960
We're being forced
to ride this endlessly.

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:26.830
FRIMON

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:34.800
Their lives are being sucked out!

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:35.840
Don't...

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:39.430
You'll only get hurt.

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:41.600
You can't ever escape.

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:44.310
No, you can't give up!

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:49.820
Soon our minds will go blank
and we'll continue to go around forever.

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:53.530
Here... forever...

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:53.030
PUROROMON

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:56.320
Forever...

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:02.330
What's this? I'm losing energy...

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:05.870
It's no use...

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:07.960
Me too...

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:16.470
Warumonzaemon has gotten
much stronger thanks to your friends!

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:21.060
They must be happily getting their life
sucked out of them in here now.

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:23.060
Why you little...

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:29.110
My sweet, sweet Warumonzaemon,

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:32.570
I wonder how much stronger you'll get
if you eat them too!

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:34.940
I can't wait!

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:39.530
Weregarurumon!

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:40.990
<i>I'm...</i>

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:44.700
<i>I'm going to stay like this...</i>

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:45.870
Takeru...

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:48.120
<i>Stay here forever...</i>

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:51.380
<i>Takeru!</i>

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:55.090
<i>Takeru! Come back, Takeru!</i>

00:17:56.470 --> 00:18:01.850
We promised we'd ride
the merry-go-round together!

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:05.180
Let's ride the merry-go-round
together next time!

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:07.560
Okay, okay.

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:11.690
You swear?

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:15.030
Yeah, all right. It's a promise.

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:18.110
<i>Takeru!</i>

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:19.910
<i>Takeru!!</i>

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:22.160
Yamato...

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:26.370
That's right, I don't want to forget...

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:28.750
my precious memories!

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:32.630
We can't forget about hope!

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:37.010
And my promise with my brother!

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:42.550
Wow.

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:43.550
Yeah.

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:47.850
Hope... We must have hope too!

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:49.310
That's right.

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:53.230
Hope! The will to never give up!

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:00.110
You guys!

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:02.570
Patamon Evolution!

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:18.970
Angemon!

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:33.560
Weregarurumon!

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:34.480
Yeah!

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:36.480
Angemon!

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:40.070
Kaiser Nail!

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:45.030
Heaven's Knuckle!

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:53.500
What?!

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:55.000
Yamato!

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:56.380
Were you okay?!

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:59.510
Oh! How dare you!

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:04.010
Warumonzaemon,
swallow all of them one more time!

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:11.890
It's useless.

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:18.020
Right now, the hope of Takeru
and these young Digimon flow within me.

00:20:18.020 --> 00:20:22.900
Everyone's hope is what granted me
my wings once more!

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:40.420
Huh?

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:53.520
Because you called out to me,
I didn't lose hope.

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.980
Welcome back, Angemon.

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:03.280
Thank you so much!

00:21:03.440 --> 00:21:07.620
One day, we'll make this
a real fun place with everyone!

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:08.700
Yeah!

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:12.040
Then we'll ride...

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:14.790
the merry-go-round.

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:18.170
Okay, it's a promise!

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:21.710
Now, let's continue our search for food.

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:24.010
We can't go back empty-handed.

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:26.550
That's true.

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.140
<i>The border has now begun to blend</i>

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.140
<i>ima mazari atteku border</i>

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.980
<i>"It's uncharted territory from here!"</i>

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.980
<i>koko kara wa jinrui mitou desu!</i>

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:38.520
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:38.520
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:42.650
<i>All that you desire awaits you</i>

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:42.650
<i>nozomu kagiri no subete ga aru kara</i>

00:21:53.740 --> 00:21:55.870
<i>The end doesn't exist, that's right</i>

00:21:53.740 --> 00:21:55.870
<i>owari nanka nai ze sou sa</i>

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:58.540
<i>We're at our starting point right now</i>

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:58.540
<i>koko wa ima bokura no shuppatsuten</i>

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:01.210
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:01.210
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:04.760
<i>There's a tomorrow that no one knows about</i>

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:04.760
<i>dare mo shiranai asu wa aru kara</i>

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:06.760
<i>So keep on smiling</i>

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:06.760
<i>waratte iyou</i>

00:22:06.920 --> 00:22:10.720
<i>We're past the point of stopping
In our daily lives</i>

00:22:06.920 --> 00:22:10.720
<i>imasara tachidomarenu bokura no
nichijou jou</i>

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:12.220
<i>Bring on the unknown!</i>

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:12.220
<i>michi joutou!</i>

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:14.560
<i>That day, I drew on the wall with you</i>

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:14.560
<i>ano hi kimi to kabe ni kaita</i>

00:22:14.720 --> 00:22:17.180
<i>The incomplete, the imperfect</i>

00:22:14.720 --> 00:22:17.180
<i>mikansei wo fukanzen wo</i>

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>"You can't go anywhere at this point"</i>

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>imasara doko e mo ikenai ze tte</i>

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:22.610
<i>Oh, is that so?! Oh, is that so?!</i>

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:22.610
<i>aa sou kai nee! aa sou kai nee!</i>

00:22:22.770 --> 00:22:28.700
<i>Then we don't want to become a grown-up</i>

00:22:22.770 --> 00:22:28.700
<i>nara otona ni nanka natcha ikenai nee</i>

00:22:31.240 --> 00:22:32.870
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.330 --> 00:22:35.540
<i>Daipenmon.</i>

00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:38.120
LEVEL: ???

00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:38.660
<i>This Digimon is said
to hold unknown abilities.</i>

00:22:38.290 --> 00:22:40.710
TYPE: CYBORG

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:42.710
<i>They say Daipenmon's ice powers
are legendary or something.</i>

00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:43.340
SPECIAL MOVE: BLUE HAWAII DEATH
ICHIGO DEATH

00:22:43.590 --> 00:22:45.170
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.340 --> 00:22:47.470
<i>The weapon on the right is Blue Hawaii</i>

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:50.260
<i>and on the left is
an </i>Ichigo<i> strawberry flavor.</i>

00:22:50.430 --> 00:22:55.060
<i>By the way, it's secretly my dream
to pour every flavor onto my shaved ice.</i>

00:22:57.600 --> 00:23:00.140
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:05.730
<i>To save the Digital World's
King of Inventors, Gerbemon from danger,</i>

00:23:05.900 --> 00:23:08.190
<i>Koshiro's intelligence grows.</i>

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:11.990
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"King of Inventors, Gerbemon"</i>

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:14.780
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
